+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-vet-003"></a>
+
+The clinic also publishes its specialties. The specialty directory answers the inverse of the veterinarian directory's question: which veterinarians hold a given specialty `[REQ-VET-003]` (decided 2026-08-24). It lists every specialty the clinic knows, under the specialty's stored name, and shows the veterinarians holding each one by full name. Every specialty is on one page, with no division into pages. A veterinarian holding no specialty appears nowhere on it, because the page lists specialties rather than the full roster. The directory is read-only: nothing on it changes a record, which leaves NG-2 unchanged. It is reached by its own address alone, with no navigation entry and no link from another page leading to it. The page itself carries the navigation every page carries `[REQ-SYS-001]`.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the clinic's specialties, when the directory is opened, then every one is listed under its stored name, on a single page.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a specialty one or more veterinarians hold, when the directory is opened, then each of them is shown by full name.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a specialty no veterinarian holds, when the directory is opened, then it is still listed and shown as held by none.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the directory is opened, then that veterinarian appears nowhere on the page.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the directory, when it is opened, then nothing on it offers to add, change, or remove a specialty or a veterinarian.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a reader who knows the directory's address, when they request it, then the page is served, and no other page links to it.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the supported languages, when the directory's wording is checked, then every piece of it is present in each.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A clinic that knows no specialties yields a page that still renders and lists none.
+2. Two specialties stored under the same name each appear as their own entry.
+3. The specialties, and the veterinarians under each, are presented in a stable order rather than an arbitrary one.
+
+**Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
+
